OL,3,ADad fined after son, 2, died in Cyprus
OL,4,Ahotel fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA father whose two-year-old boy fell to
OL,7,Fhis death at a five-star hotel in
OL,8,FCyprus has been fined 3,000 euro
OL,9,F(#2,500).
OL,11,FJoshua Foster thought the window was
OL,12,Fclosed when he placed the boy on a sill
OL,13,Fto show him the view of a waterpark and
OL,14,F"lost control" of him, Paphos District
OL,15,FCourt previously heard.
OL,17,FThe boy fell nearly 40ft (12.1m) from
OL,18,Fthe fourth floor of the King Evelthon
OL,19,FBeach Hotel and Resort on 12 July, the
OL,20,Ffirst day of the family's holiday in
OL,21,FChlorakas.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
